100
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:17,295
WELCOME TO THAILAND.

101
00:04:17,295 --> 00:04:20,932
THIS IS THE TEMPLE OF DAWN,
AND MY NAME IS PICHITA.

102
00:04:20,932 --> 00:04:25,336
I AM A FORMER MODEL, AND NOW
