THE PEOPLE WILL LIKE YOU.

108
00:04:42,387 --> 00:04:44,856
I THINK EVERYBODY UNDERSTANDS
THAT LEARNING THE CULTURE

109
00:04:44,856 --> 00:04:46,925
IS IMPORTANT,
BUT I DON'T THINK ANYBODY

110
00:04:46,925 --> 00:04:48,760
