AS SERIOUSLY AS I AM.

111
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:51,329
I SET UP GO-SEES TODAY.

112
00:04:51,329 --> 00:04:55,333
A GO-SEE IS WHEN YOU TAKE
YOUR PORTFOLIO TO A CLIENT

113
00:04:55,333 --> 00:04:56,901
