AND PRETTY MUCH THEY DECIDE,

114
00:04:56,901 --> 00:04:58,403
"YES, WE WANT YOU,"

115
00:04:58,403 --> 00:04:59,938
OR, "NO, WE DON'T WANT
TO BOOK YOU FOR THIS JOB."

116
00:04:59,938 --> 00:05:03,575
THE DESIGNER WILL JUDGE YOU
ON THAI SOCIAL CUSTOM,

117
00:05:03,575 --> 00:05:06,344
YOUR GENERAL APPEARANCE,
YOUR MODEL BOOK,

118
00:05:06,344 --> 00:05:07,712
AND YOUR RUNWAY WALK.

119
00:05:19,924 --> 00:05:23,495
AND NOW I GOING TO GIVE YOU
A MAP AND MODEL BOOK.

120
00:05:23,495 --> 00:05:25,830
AT THE END, PICHITA
GIVES US OUR PORTFOLIOS,

121
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:27,899
AND IT'S ACTUALLY
REALLY EXCITING.

122
00:05:27,899 --> 00:05:29,434
JUST SEEING
EVERY SINGLE PICTURE

123
00:05:29,434 --> 00:05:31,870
JUST REMINDS OF THAT DAY
