(laughs)

152
00:06:41,806 --> 00:06:43,374
THAT'S A GOOD WAY TO START.

153
00:06:43,374 --> 00:06:44,876
(speaks Thai)

154
00:06:44,876 --> 00:06:47,745
AFTER I GET MY GIFT, I RUSH OUT
TO GET IN MY TUK-TUK.

155
