TUK-TUKS ARE,
LIKE, MINIATURE CABS,

156
00:06:51,349 --> 00:06:53,318
BUT THEY'RE ALL OPEN
ON THE SIDES.

157
00:06:53,318 --> 00:06:54,619
RIGHT HERE.

158
00:06:54,619 --> 00:06:56,921
WE GO?

159
00:06:56,921 --> 00:07:00,692
IF IT WAS UP TO ME, I WOULDN'T
HAVE CHOSE TO RIDE IN A TUTU.

160
00:07:00,692 --> 00:07:02,460
HOO-HOO.
POO-POO.

161
00:07:02,460 --> 00:07:05,563
TUT-TUT.
HOOPDIE, OKAY?

162
00:07:05,563 --> 00:07:07,298
BECAUSE I WOULD HAVE
HAD SOMETHING WITH WINDOWS,

163
00:07:07,298 --> 00:07:08,566
SOMETHING WITH DOORS.

164
00:07:11,803 --> 00:07:14,539
I'VE NEVER BEEN ON A GO-SEE
BEFORE IN MY LIFE, SO THE FACT

165
00:07:14,539 --> 00:07:16,441
THAT WE'RE DOING THEM
IN A DIFFERENT COUNTRY,

166
00:07:16,441 --> 00:07:19,410
AND IN THE COURSE OF ABOUT
FOUR HOURS,

167
00:07:19,410 --> 00:07:20,712
