A LITTLE MORE PRESSURE ON.

168
00:07:20,712 --> 00:07:21,913
RIGHT HERE.

169
00:07:21,913 --> 00:07:23,515
I'M GONNA TRY--
I'M NOT GOOD WITH DIRECTIONS.

170
00:07:23,515 --> 00:07:24,749
I CANNOT READ MAPS.

171
00:07:24,749 --> 00:07:28,553
PERSONALLY, I'M TERRIFIED,
