181
00:07:50,408 --> 00:07:51,843
WHILE I'M GOING
TO THE GO-SEES.

182
00:07:51,843 --> 00:07:53,978
BUT, I MEAN, IT'S ONE THING TO,
LIKE, KNOW IT IN YOUR HEAD,

183
00:07:53,978 --> 00:07:55,547
AND THEN IT'S ANOTHER THING,
LIKE, IN THE MOMENT,

184
00:07:55,547 --> 00:07:56,581
