219
00:09:37,515 --> 00:09:40,952
I WORE A BEAUTIFUL LINGERIE
PIECE, AND I WAS A CHIPMUNK.

220
00:09:40,952 --> 00:09:42,420
IT WAS KIND OF HARD
SEEING OUT OF IT,

221
00:09:42,420 --> 00:09:43,855
BUT I THINK
I HELD IT TOGETHER.

222
00:09:43,855 --> 00:09:46,424
I LIKE JADE'S LOOK.

