244
00:10:59,197 --> 00:11:00,465
(laughs)

245
00:11:00,465 --> 00:11:01,632
IT WAS A LITTLE INTIMIDATING

246
00:11:01,632 --> 00:11:03,267
WHEN SHE
WALKED IN THE DOOR.

247
00:11:03,267 --> 00:11:06,838
I'M NOT SURE IF I HAVE ENOUGH
