248
00:11:06,838 --> 00:11:08,740
TO OUR FINAL DESTINATION.

249
00:11:10,608 --> 00:11:11,876
GOOD.

250
00:11:11,876 --> 00:11:13,244
I THINK I DID PRETTY WELL.
