251
00:11:13,244 --> 00:11:13,845
I'M HAVING A GOOD TIME.

252
00:11:18,182 --> 00:11:19,917
IT'S HOT OUTSIDE,
IT'S HUMID.

253
00:11:19,917 --> 00:11:22,387
DO YOU KNOW WHAT THAT DOES
TO A BLACK GIRL'S HEAD?

254
00:11:22,387 --> 00:11:24,789
DANIELLE, I REALLY LIKED HER,
ACTUALLY.

255
00:11:24,789 --> 00:11:25,890
I THOUGHT SHE WAS
REALLY BEAUTIFUL.

256
00:11:25,890 --> 00:11:27,859
I LIKED HER ATTITUDE.

257
00:11:27,859 --> 00:11:29,293
I REALLY DON'T KNOW
WHO'S GONNA WIN.

258
00:11:29,293 --> 00:11:30,561
LIKE, I HAVEN'T
SEEN THE OTHER GIRLS

259
00:11:30,561 --> 00:11:31,929
OR TALKED TO 'EM,
SO, YOU KNOW,

260
00:11:31,929 --> 00:11:33,531
WE'LL SEE
WHEN EVERYBODY MEETS UP.

261
00:11:33,531 --> 00:11:35,400
HOTEL.

262
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:36,634
- HUH?
- RIGHT HERE.

263
00:11:36,634 --> 00:11:37,969
- HOTEL.

264
00:11:37,969 --> 00:11:39,737
HOTEL, FAST.

265
00:11:39,737 --> 00:11:40,972
(speaks Thai)
GOT TO GO.

266
00:11:40,972 --> 00:11:42,306
(driver speaking Thai)

267
00:11:42,306 --> 00:11:43,474
HOTEL...
YOU UNDERSTAND ME?

268
00:11:43,474 --> 00:11:45,410
RIGHT THERE.

269
00:11:45,410 --> 00:11:47,712
DO NOT PASS GO,
DO NOT COLLECT $200.

270
00:11:47,712 --> 00:11:48,679
HOTEL.

271
00:11:53,284 --> 00:11:54,752
SO I FIGURED I WOULD HAVE
PLENTY OF TIME TO BE BACK,

272
00:11:54,752 --> 00:11:57,622
BUT THE TRAFFIC HERE
IS UNBELIEVABLE.

273
00:11:57,622 --> 00:12:00,525
WILL WE MAKE IT BY 4:30?

274
00:12:00,525 --> 00:12:02,527
AY-YI-YI-YI-YI.

275
00:12:02,527 --> 00:12:03,795
WE'RE GONNA BE LATE.

276
00:12:03,795 --> 00:12:06,264
LATE, LATE, LATE,
LATE, LATE.

277
00:12:15,373 --> 00:12:18,709
♪♪♪

278
00:12:18,709 --> 00:12:19,877
HELLO.

279
00:12:19,877 --> 00:12:22,847
WE GET BACK AFTER THE GO-SEES
TO SEE PICHITA,

280
00:12:22,847 --> 00:12:24,482
